    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571090/extras/7a34e02b6401d488ad7dac678c1e1a30.avif?t=1721047447\" /></div><br>A beastly crime investigation drama across times! Are you able to solve the thrilling mysteries in <strong>Beast Crimes</strong>?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571090/extras/ac820a6a07ae4342a6f901e64a7f0f91.avif?t=1721047447\" /></div><br>2 cases set in the far-future Neo Tokyo! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Ranking system</strong>: Track and improve your different skills. How good you are at each will increase or limit the various options to solve the puzzles.<br></li><li><strong>Reaper</strong>: Your choices decides which persons are going to die and when.<br></li><li><strong>Clock</strong>: Decied what to do during your mornings, afternoons, evenings and nights.<br></li><li><strong>Escape Rooms</strong>: Solve puzzles and escape deadly rooms<br></li><li><strong>Clue Tree</strong>: Collect clues and unlock new ones with the Clue Tree<br></li><li><strong>Cross-examination</strong>: Interrogate suspect<br></li><li><strong>Moral Tree</strong>: Uncover the suspect true morality</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571090/extras/c0cd6aafd041267ead6f263575f5476d.avif?t=1721047447\" /></div><br>3 cases set in the distant past Ancient Egypt!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Scale of Justice</strong>: Your choice of questions and their answers will decied the fate.<br></li><li><strong>The eye of wisdom</strong>: See the true thoughts of people who are lying.<br></li><li><strong>Dowsing Rod</strong>: Use a dowsing rod to find body parts.<br></li><li><strong>Negotiation</strong>: Observe people's emotions and change your approach depending on them.<br></li><li><strong>Widened perspective</strong>: Inspect selected areas through panoramic view.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571090/extras/08dcf29ed2c87a29715729a56804d58e.avif?t=1721047447\" /></div><br>3 cases set in the present 21st Century!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Investigation</strong>: Study the surrounding and characters then write it down in your journal.<br></li><li><strong>Inventory</strong>: Collect evidence and show them to suspects for view their reactions.<br></li><li><strong>Maps</strong>: Several different location to choose to visit.<br></li><li><strong>Interrogate</strong>: Battle of wits, argument and prove who is behind the crimes.</li></ul>",
